sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar
    participant REST as REST Server<br/>FastAPI/uvicorn<br/>8080/TCP
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>grpc.aio<br/>8081/TCP
    participant DP as DataPlane<br/>Handler
    participant RT as Model Runtime<br/>(sklearn/xgboost/onnx/...)
    participant Models as /mnt/models<br/>Model Storage
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8082/TCP
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector

    Note over Client, OTel: Inference Request Flow (REST)
    Client->>KRBP: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / SA Token
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate OAuth/SA Token
    KRBP->>REST: Forward authenticated request<br/>HTTP/8080
    REST->>REST: PrometheusMiddleware records metrics
    REST->>DP: Route to DataPlane handler
    DP->>RT: Dispatch to framework runtime
    RT->>Models: Load model artifacts (if not cached)
    Models-->>RT: Model weights/config
    RT-->>DP: Prediction result
    DP-->>REST: InferenceResponse
    REST-->>KRBP: JSON Response
    KRBP-->>Client: 200 OK + predictions

    Note over Client, OTel: Inference Request Flow (gRPC)
    Client->>KRBP: gRPC ModelInfer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / SA Token
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate OAuth/SA Token
    KRBP->>GRPC: Forward authenticated request<br/>gRPC/8081
    GRPC->>GRPC: LoggingInterceptor + PromServerInterceptor
    GRPC->>DP: Dispatch via GRPCInferenceService
    DP->>RT: Dispatch to framework runtime
    RT-->>DP: Prediction result
    DP-->>GRPC: ModelInferResponse (protobuf)
    GRPC-->>KRBP: gRPC Response
    KRBP-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over Client, OTel: Streaming Inference Flow
    Client->>KRBP: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer_stream<br/>or gRPC ModelStreamInfer
    KRBP->>REST: Forward (REST streaming)
    REST->>DP: Stream dispatch
    DP->>RT: Streaming inference
    loop Incremental responses
        RT-->>DP: Partial result
        DP-->>REST: SSE chunk
        REST-->>KRBP: Stream chunk
        KRBP-->>Client: Stream chunk
    end

    Note over Client, OTel: Model Lifecycle Management
    Client->>KRBP: POST /v2/repository/models/{name}/load
    KRBP->>REST: Forward
    REST->>DP: Model load request
    DP->>Models: Load model from MLSERVER_MODELS_DIR
    Models-->>DP: Model loaded
    DP-->>REST: Load confirmation
    REST-->>KRBP: 200 OK
    KRBP-->>Client: Model loaded

    Note over Client, OTel: Observability Pipeline
    Prom->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>8082/TCP (no auth)
    Metrics-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    REST-.->OTel: OTLP gRPC traces<br/>(when tracing_server configured)
    GRPC-.->OTel: OTLP gRPC traces<br/>(when tracing_server configured)
